<page-meta page-style="background-color:#0a0e14;" />
<nav-bar title="队伍" />

<view class="page">
  <view class="pad">
    <view class="head">
      <view class="head-copy grow">
        <text class="t-title">我的队伍</text>
        <text class="t-sub">{{count}} 支 · 保存在本机</text>
      </view>
      <view class="btn btn-primary btn-sm" bindtap="createTeam" hover-class="press-hover">新建队伍</view>
    </view>

    <view wx:if="{{teams.length}}" class="teams">
      <view
        wx:for="{{teams}}"
        wx:key="id"
        class="team press"
        data-id="{{item.id}}"
        bindtap="openTeam"
        hover-class="press-hover"
      >
        <view class="team-head">
          <text class="team-name ellipsis">{{item.name}}</text>
          <text class="team-count num">{{item.count}}/6</text>
        </view>

        <view class="team-slots">
          <block wx:for="{{item.slots}}" wx:for-item="slot" wx:key="key">
            <image wx:if="{{!slot.empty}}" class="team-sprite" src="{{slot.sprite}}" mode="aspectFit" lazy-load />
            <view wx:else class="team-sprite team-slot-empty">+</view>
          </block>
        </view>

        <view class="team-foot">
          <text class="t-mini">更新于 {{item.updated}}</text>
          <text class="team-go">进入编辑 ›</text>
        </view>
      </view>
    </view>

    <empty-state
      wx:else
      icon="plus"
      title="还没有队伍"
      desc="创建一支队伍，配置宝可梦、招式与能力值，再做伤害推演"
      actionText="新建队伍"
      bind:action="createTeam"
    />

    <view class="foot-note">
      队伍只保存在本机，不会上传服务器。能力值按 Lv.50 / IV 31 / 0–32 SP 计算。
    </view>
  </view>
</view>
